OL,3,ADemocrats take control of US Congress
OL,4,Aas voters resoundingly reject Trump's
OL,5,ARepublicans
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Democrats win the Senate and the
OL,8,FHouse in US midterm elections, taking
OL,9,Fcontrol of Congress for the rest of
OL,10,FDonald Trump's presidency
OL,12,FTrump says the Democrats "did a good
OL,13,Fjob" - and acknowledges the Iran war,
OL,14,Fand higher fuel prices, played a part
OL,15,Fin the defeat
OL,17,FIn the Senate race, Democrats picked up
OL,18,Fa string of victories in Republican
OL,19,Fstrongholds, including Texas, Ohio, and
OL,20,FKansas - which last elected a Democrat
OL,21,Falmost 100 years ago
